      <table border="1" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;">
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#D3D3D3"><strong>Team Member:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#D3D3D3">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Team_Member__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Date of Initiative:</strong></td>
    <td><apex:outputText value="{0,date,MM/dd/yy}">
        <apex:param value="{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Date_of_Initiative__c}" />
    </apex:outputText></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>Synopsis of Initiative:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Synopsis_of_Initiative__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Initiative Region:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Initiative_Region__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>Initiative location name:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Initiative_location_name__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Initiative Category:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Initiative_Category__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>Name of Point Person from Initiative:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Name_of_Point_Person_from_Initiative__r.name}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>What materials did you bring with you? Check all that Apply:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.What_materials_did_you_bring_with_you__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>If you brought a catered lunch or breakfast, where did you order food from:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Catered_Breakfast_Lunch_Provider__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>If you brought a catered lunch or breakfast,how much did you spend?:</strong></td>
    <td><apex:outputText rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(Marketing_Campaign__c.Catered_Breakfast_Lunch_Cost__c))}" 
                         value="${!Marketing_Campaign__c.Catered_Breakfast_Lunch_Cost__c}" /></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>If you brought a catered lunch or breakfast, how many people did you feed?:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Total_People_Fed_from_Catered_Meal__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Link to receipt:</strong></td>
    <td>No field needed </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>How long were you there (approximate minutes):</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.How_long_were_you_there__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Who went with you?:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Who_went_with_you__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>How many potential patients had hands-on contact with a provider?:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Potential_Patients_with_HandsOn_Provider__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>What are the next steps after this drop in? Check all that apply:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Next_Steps_After_Drop_In__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>Did you book any patients for appointments? (HOT LEADS):</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Did_You_Book_Any_Patient_Appointments__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
      <td><strong>No of HOT Leads:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.No_of_HOT_Leads__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>What about this initiative did not lead to any bookings (HOT LEADS)? Be specific and detailed:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Reason_No_Hot_Leads_Were_Scheduled__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Did you capture any prospective patients' contact information? (COOL LEADS):</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Captured_Prospective_Patient_Contacts__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>No of COOL Leads:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.No_of_COOL_Leads__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>What about this initiative did not lead to any prospective patients contact capture (COOL LEADS)? Be specific and detailed:</strong></td>
    <td>{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Reason_No_Cool_Leads_Were_Scheduled__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6"><strong>How many total potential patients were interacted with?:</strong></td>
    <td style="background-color:#ADD8E6">{!Marketing_Campaign__c.Total_Potential_Patient_Interactions__c}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

    <!-- Add other fields as needed -->
  </body>
</apex:page>